msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_79B311FB_7D6D_4461_ABCC_6EEC3B8E85DB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It was picturesque."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Era un’immagine pittoresca."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E40F536E_2011_4E5B_8A02_79D40DFD0443
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc4aa9b94b30ebd793f0b8afee2e2ae33d898e4f7ae1c52b91048fcdebf26ab0
#. default-sha256: 9cbad92e5f2aef60ca226ec2e63026a7ec112b0c45c50073bf84d6ec89df6eeb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E40F536E_2011_4E5B_8A02_79D40DFD0443"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And you were always there with me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E tu eri sempre lì con me."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6D4A6043_416B_46F2_A818_09047036F42A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee7cfa9901c93714ffc5bc1111e451500319ecf4690c9faa10b8328262ce9b92
#. default-sha256: c94aed1e560847be1a6e673d27f042d34b4988752a9dd259218cac5e77d5f128
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6D4A6043_416B_46F2_A818_09047036F42A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Following my seventeenth birthday, though, I was met with a deluge of changes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tuttavia, a seguito del mio diciassettesimo compleanno,⟪k:2⟫dovetti affrontare un gran "
"numero di cambiamenti."

#: scenario8:scenario8_883F4211_6033_496C_BE63_ED1944B379B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a16a203147c604ba134903837a632cdc4dd03b1e01a6d62306ca73792c2d02ce
#. default-sha256: f568caec9eeb3c5591169e0c3043c8255c004ee27d6212b6d14d3e2797fb048c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_883F4211_6033_496C_BE63_ED1944B379B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫First, Father fell ill... ⟪k:1⟫and passed away shortly thereafter...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫With his death "
"came the question of who would be the next head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per prima cosa, nostro Padre si ammalò... ⟪k:1⟫e morì poco dopo...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Con la sua morte "
"emerse la questione su chi sarebbe stato l’erede."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E8664530_9C0B_4427_A024_B001D2D828C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c40bc8cc1eaf3ceec4b56535e78d17bdb28cd33b2871d7ccb7ac206fe58d8136
#. default-sha256: cc35a77542eb44222a4e0ff62096d5fb3614aeda820ea1a500a32d470f9683f4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E8664530_9C0B_4427_A024_B001D2D828C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was seventeen, by all means enough of an adult to handle things myself. ⟪k:1⟫Or, well, "
"that’s what I thought, anyway."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avevo diciassette anni, più che sufficienti perché potessi occuparmi⟪k:1⟫di tutto. ⟪k:2⟫O "
"meglio, questo è quello che pensavo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2D6EA55_93D4_4349_B408_461C0E607BBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a7c0fc1387dbcccc2e3139f8e862df6b3508da8d09e2f5126306fc02580a1cd
#. default-sha256: 99115ce7debdd1ee6d26d860a5183787a6b08ec9ded32e8924b8bb03777eed38
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D2D6EA55_93D4_4349_B408_461C0E607BBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a small house, far from home—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫his way of making it hard for me to come back. "
"⟪k:3⟫Not that I had any intention of returning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era una piccola abitazione, molto distante da casa nostra—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫era il suo modo di "
"rendermi difficile poter fare ritorno.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Non che ne avessi l’intenzione..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9ED9BC65_C2CF_4A8C_B5AD_A023DD82E8A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6bb637d8829366a672db5cdbb16dd9fad85f2135d8ba3934b7e822eccdc7dc9
#. default-sha256: e2dbddfb339708a3ad8cd76fff9c496ad14a08ab7f91794e032b98c66c6c37e6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9ED9BC65_C2CF_4A8C_B5AD_A023DD82E8A8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was you coming with me, Nellie."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫fu che tu venisti con me, Nellie."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A707CFE_FA03_44E0_A1D5_9FF34BAF6EC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02e1c6b910f546b4d12cde8f6b6732561cede4e904f629c8177321ae1f12f58b
#. default-sha256: 4928cd6e759f6d163968193f4650656bccd3c2087b56074b04ce2297fa82f59f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A707CFE_FA03_44E0_A1D5_9FF34BAF6EC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Yep, so it is..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Già..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3B09AAB0_11F7_4DC2_8A1E_301630E77B6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9508b82ed4ad61b96092ebc94e109505cffc1eeebbb4b16ef47dc7a2a0f190c5
#. default-sha256: 80650176736ba996df8bf952dd90bd609975b5407ac0fd62ec4d201fb5011436
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3B09AAB0_11F7_4DC2_8A1E_301630E77B6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’s amazing how... ⟪k:1⟫little there is.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No big yard, no paintings, no vases "
"filled with colorful flowers,⟪k:4⟫no silver bowls full of fresh-picked fruit..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ incredibile quanto poco ci sia.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Nessun cortile, nessun quadro, "
"nessun vaso pieno di fiori colorati,⟪k:5⟫nessun vassoio d’argento colmo di frutta fresca..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_56069B73_DD4D_4AD7_946C_E8F53FDA49CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01f09440ddd673580426b355629c6fe48d367134e590d5cc1d984cde078257ba
#. default-sha256: 288199b21a72a5ba39cb9912d272259524c3394e23e5cee38281683c27ad1238
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_56069B73_DD4D_4AD7_946C_E8F53FDA49CA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’ll do whatever I can for you, dearest Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are you hungry? I’m hungry."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Farò tutto il possibile per te, mio caro Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hai fame? Io sì."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2D83A47_3DEB_471B_8B8A_BEC74F5135A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb7f7c98a1c2ba1ae07b0a3f4dcfd77cbdb6b2c88dbeb85be7c11a5a4c92f9ca
#. default-sha256: 7a3cbbf6f88a2ae3cbdf7467c89f15ca7dbb81e48e781a0ed76bd684cdec68d4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D2D83A47_3DEB_471B_8B8A_BEC74F5135A1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh, ⟪k:3⟫uh, ⟪k:4⟫yeah... ⟪k:5⟫a bit..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah, ⟪k:3⟫ehm, ⟪k:4⟫sì... ⟪k:5⟫un po’..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_456D81FB_F82E_47BD_97A1_82A739013DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80489b7d0d41a665c176132fc767debfeb677405b19faf62b2371fe2c9322473
#. default-sha256: ae059205791c1d5ee95f2054f018abc2f45b3f2e909d838aff3d7138711c91b9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_456D81FB_F82E_47BD_97A1_82A739013DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ahaha... ⟪k:3⟫You’ve got quite the sweet tooth.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You’re going to make "
"yourself sick like that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ahahah... ⟪k:3⟫Hai proprio un debole per i dolci, eh?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ti ammalerai se "
"continui così."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E889B4A3_99B7_4667_B645_7DCF4851A94B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48c8a94d111f139223c168bcbdfb1953d29585aa956bd7a6a9e7edb6c8c1bb50
#. default-sha256: 7291a3f11530bdc5b31007af6d78dbf8a5492baf8db49f4f0fc580e5c6d40602
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E889B4A3_99B7_4667_B645_7DCF4851A94B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nope. You’ve been frowny all day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No. Hai tenuto il broncio tutto il giorno."

#: scenario8:scenario8_767724A6_D98E_4BD5_AFF8_BA858482FB90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2228bd7f986d32f47e137e269ade1e177efc7fec874b52e8326f3ccdf8c19f72
#. default-sha256: 74ea59a002e7c3b3bf12e91d4ccff1fc6bef239d73da5e2aa8b5e8d4990d7a0b
