msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But right now, I know you need God’s word.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Starting tonight, you’re "
"getting your own private sermon every night, understand?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dovresti seguire gli insegnamenti di Dio.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A partire da oggi, pregheremo "
"insieme ogni sera, intesi?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6CC2EFAF_5C70_4CDF_B251_54E40AB6EB4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
