msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫My instruction was as much for my own sake as it was for Nellie’s."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Le mie istruzioni non erano solo per il bene di Nellie, ma anche per il ⟪k:4⟫"
"mio⟪k:5⟫ bene."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E5EE242A_5B5D_43F7_8C7F_E2378B160EDF
