msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything’s going to be back to normal soon..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Presto tutto tornerà alla normalità..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0423FDF5_FF77_4665_8471_0BFCAFBE6DA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2017ec4e96d49f9bbc48b4b343ace6a4b028eb3cad33e0a1dbf97454edd3da34
