msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0423FDF5_FF77_4665_8471_0BFCAFBE6DA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I searched everywhere for some medicine that could cure her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Healthy foods, fruits "
"and vegetables with supposed medicinal properties—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫anything I could get my hands on."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Andai ovunque in cerca di medicine che potessero farla guarire.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Cibi sani, frutta o "
"verdure con presunte proprietà medicinali—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫qualunque cosa avessi potuto trovare."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6956578F_0EA8_47FA_BEAD_3D9CE72F54C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6e30b33d8bc3857b723afb5a8e23f4a33cb2dbe416f29c69c79c472c1faa6ee
