msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was really doing it for myself..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫è che lo stavo facendo per me stesso..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2BF65C28_D0EF_4D1A_8512_2F5231A14D79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8f94b64821ffea0bc083be0bfbbc356a21ac93537aac702c43f84aa00cde199
