msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2BF65C28_D0EF_4D1A_8512_2F5231A14D79"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would go to bed at night afraid I’d wake up the next morning...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and Nellie "
"wouldn’t."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Andavo a letto la notte col terrore di alzarmi l’indomani...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫e vedere che Nellie "
"non si svegliava più."

#: scenario8:scenario8_758D1741_451D_42C8_8E0D_94FF9BF61F48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 848aafcfa508031337a99a9efdb43c8ff3db3cd3ce5333c97f827cbfb223c7da
#. default-sha256: ceb12da7e64560ecbe6473cbd8b3ad2b971001a559d1c04839b91ef2281252bc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_758D1741_451D_42C8_8E0D_94FF9BF61F48"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then one day, I heard whispers—⟪k:1⟫whispers of a witch who lived by the lake."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E poi, un giorno, udii delle voci... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dicevano che vicino al lago viveva una strega."

#: scenario8:scenario8_028B8958_691D_4F59_8716_03D9CB1616A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88693e3bd2fb5a3ec23d9dc7b19947595f2e905b604a8e4bd5e978605196e57a
#. default-sha256: 8de949ed776ec6625cc2c9dc175e9d8961dea62ca7af472072d02e1b4566d037
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_028B8958_691D_4F59_8716_03D9CB1616A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seeing the thin trails of smoke rising from the chimney, I was convinced the rumors were "
"true. A witch lived in that house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vedendo le sottili scie di fumo che salivano dal comignolo,⟪k:1⟫mi convinsi che le voci "
"fossero vere. In quella casa abitava una strega."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A3DB912_0F1D_4E9B_BA67_426404BF8468
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 876dbc64b266f956b3e39283a85bdf09fb9b52f355e6940559d8455cf8d862a6
#. default-sha256: ba9fa794bf85cd71f3745715273ca022733bb71f70119cdfff0b940b884d825a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A3DB912_0F1D_4E9B_BA67_426404BF8468"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure what to expect. Being a recluse, I figured she wasn’t going to be very "
"sociable, at least. ⟪k:1⟫To tell you the truth, I was kind of scared to knock on her door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non sapevo cosa aspettarmi. ⟪k:1⟫Vivendo da reclusa, pensai che non sarebbe stata molto "
"socievole.⟪k:2⟫ Ad essere sincero, avevo paura di bussare alla sua porta."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9873A66F_9A39_4DE5_B2CA_8367360A0FCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9428bd5abf887dbe121491f789ac651a4e03babc5398acd6bba8619b26ae95a
#. default-sha256: 9c75ab0d66c923d70011db5b7a5fb9dfad45eb98990ad92c6dd6890a00a53a3a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9873A66F_9A39_4DE5_B2CA_8367360A0FCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And even though she’d only said two words, there was something... ⟪k:1⟫indescribably "
"enchanting about that voice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E anche se aveva detto solo due parole,⟪k:1⟫c’era qualcosa... ⟪k:2⟫di incredibilmente "
"incantevole nella sua voce."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CCBC4967_FFFA_4687_85F8_B4D94E23F6B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4de60f3dcc8132dd3006454c733f6a8c685608c8b373a076041336ff1f0ecfe
