msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Chi è?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0408CBB2_F9C7_4690_B5DD_06FB542FBEF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da7250998f91ae3f96f53c8298be00d129e099802c37974251a5d8e418b9ff2a
#. default-sha256: 638aeb06d1b104fa3633e9ad8a0167f0b365b8f70e088e645d34e4a4a5d21970
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0408CBB2_F9C7_4690_B5DD_06FB542FBEF8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She repeated her question, which brought me back to reality, ⟪k:1⟫though I still had to "
"fight to maintain my wits enough to respond coherently."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ripeté la domanda, riportandomi alla realtà, ⟪k:1⟫tuttavia dovetti comunque sforzarmi per "
"riuscire a rispondere correttamente."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2FB7C6B2_E1E4_40FD_9D03_BCD0FDDC7FD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d2c0d883d522da9f15aa0a842983fdec3b9ab8bf0953f287caa3d19664e0cad
#. default-sha256: 93ff2e3fb6c1fbd2ab4014e944156fb51a652d76abb61e5836b487d78fc305fb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2FB7C6B2_E1E4_40FD_9D03_BCD0FDDC7FD2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, ⟪k:1⟫uh, ⟪k:2⟫she’s got an extremely high fever that won’t come down...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She has "
"no appetite—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫she’s only drinking water—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫and she can’t get out of bed..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, ⟪k:1⟫ehm, ⟪k:2⟫ha una febbre molto alta che non accenna a diminuire...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Non ha "
"appetito—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫beve soltanto acqua—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫e non riesce ad alzarsi dal letto..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D1E81EE0_61A3_402A_BBA0_6E92397B5916
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
