"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I-⟪k:3⟫Is it really that strange?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I mean, we’re almost the same age,⟪k:6⟫"
"so I figured we might make pretty good friends."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫È⟪k:4⟫... ⟪k:5⟫davvero tanto strano?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Insomma, abbiamo quasi la "
"stessa età, così ho pensato che magari avremmo potuto fare amicizia."

