msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Yeah. We’re both young, but we’ve been through some rough times..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Già.⟪k:3⟫ Siamo entrambi giovani,⟪k:4⟫ma abbiamo attraversato momenti difficili..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_225300E5_6E71_448E_91B6_E64CD72907E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
