msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I will not tell you about myself, no.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That said... ⟪k:4⟫I do appreciate the "
"concern.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Thank you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No, non ti parlerò di me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Detto questo... ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫apprezzo il tuo interesse."
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Ti ringrazio."

